   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "49fd2b2d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Modelo 4: CSP + Wavelets + XGBoost\n",
    "\n",
    "Se concatenan 4 log-varianzas CSP con la log-varianza de cinco\n",
    "grupos de coeficientes wavelet db4 por canal: A4, D4, D3, D2 y D1. El vector\n",
    "tiene `4 + (5 × 5) = 29` características.\n",
    "\n",
    "El notebook distingue dos preguntas:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Generalización entre sujetos:** los sujetos de prueba nunca aparecen en entrenamiento.\n",
    "- **Rendimiento individual:** evaluación estratificada dentro del sujeto A1."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eff7ab11",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Importaciones y reproducibilidad\n",
    "\n",
    "Las transformaciones que aprenden parámetros —CSP y escalado— permanecen dentro\n",
    "del pipeline para evitar fuga de información durante validación cruzada."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c2c63eb6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import mne\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from sklearn.base import BaseEstimator, TransformerMixin, clone\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import (\n",
    "    ConfusionMatrixDisplay,\n",
    "    accuracy_score,\n",
    "    balanced_accuracy_score,\n",
    "    classification_report,\n",
    ")\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import (\n",
    "    StratifiedGroupKFold,\n",
    "    StratifiedKFold,\n",
    "    cross_validate,\n",
    "    cross_val_predict,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\", category=RuntimeWarning)\n",
    "mne.set_log_level(\"WARNING\")\n",
    "RANDOM_STATE = 42\n",
    "\n",
    "from mne.decoding import CSP\n",
    "from sklearn.pipeline import FeatureUnion, Pipeline\n",
    "from xgboost import XGBClassifier"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0e6f3275",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
